  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.52,
    "text": "When you are diagnosed with cancer, inevitably when people find out they will tell you about"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 5.52,
    "end": 11.04,
    "text": "some miracle cure that worked for their cousin or their uncle. I have heard a lot of these,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 11.04,
    "end": 16.88,
    "text": "I'm not easily surprised, but today I heard a new one, so I'm wondering if other people have heard"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 16.88,
    "end": 27.5,
    "text": "of this. Venus fly trout. Yes, the carnivorous plants, apparently you blend up three to four of them"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 27.5,
    "end": 29.97,
    "text": "and eats them every day."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 29.97,
    "end": 31.13,
    "text": "And that kills your cancer."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 31.13,
    "end": 32.97,
    "text": "So has anyone heard of that one yet?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 32.97,
    "end": 34.73,
    "text": "Because that was a new one for me."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 34.73,
    "end": 35.81,
    "text": "Kind of fun."
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 35.81,
    "end": 37.53,
    "text": "Let me know if you've tried it and it works."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 37.53,
    "end": 38.93,
    "text": "Sending you so much love."
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 38.93,
    "end": 39.77,
    "text": "Aloha."
   }
  ]
 },
